  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Stay**: with War vocals [2]\n- **Do It Again &**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Alladin [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2003-04-10.km140.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 11 songs; 125 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: War vocals [1]\n- Erick Coomes of Lettuce joined on bass, marked in the setlist as a guest appearance on the closing song [1]\n- Printz Board of the Black Eyed Peas guested on trumpet, also during the ampersand-marked portion of the show [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2003-04-10.km140.flac16**: taped by Michel Pacifici & Andrew Rakow; transferred by Michel Pacifici & Andrew Rakow; source: onstage Neumann KM140 (split 8')-> Lunatec V2-> Apogee AD1000 > Sony D8 @ 44.1 [1]. Also: Taping is labeled km140, a FLAC16 transfer, presented as one set on a single disc running about 80 minutes [1]",
